mini: tiny self-hosting foundation for language projects
Usage: mini check [--docs | SOURCE.mini | -] | fmt [--write | --check] SOURCE.mini | run SOURCE.mini [ARG]... | test [FILTER] | bench OUTPUT [FILTER] | verify [CASE.json] | release OUTPUT [TAG] | compile
Aliases: mini-check, mini-format, mini-run, mini-test, mini-bench, mini-verify, mini-release, mini-compile, minic
